    <item>
      <title>Orbit 2026.11.13.1959</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:59:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611131959</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.13.1959</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/siosphere/orbit-updates/releases/tag/v202611131959</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <orbit:note>The split pane divider now highlights on hover and while dragging, and the focus ring fades between panes.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Tab rows in the sidebar now fade in a hover highlight, and the selected tab's highlight slides between rows. They also use the new close button.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>GitHub live folders can now auto-remove merged or closed PRs after a delay, optionally closing their tabs.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>A late response from a previous account no longer shows its private repo names to the current one.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The sidebar now fades as it collapses and expands, and dragging its edge to resize works like the Mac app.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Panes now animate when one is added or removed.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Sidebar rows now show a loading spinner on slow pages, plus speaker and mute buttons, dimmed unloaded titles, and open or closed folder icons.</orbit:note>
